<http://data.silknow.org/object/f0f470a3-9902-38e9-8702-6775cf6b648b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Hanging pocket case. Three rectangular pockets, one above the other, with a triangular upside down pocket at the top. A white silk ground quilted and embroidered with white silk and floss silk yarns. Designs include: a peacock and swan, a monogram topped by a crown, a heraldic rampant horse on a round shield with a helmet crest flanked and supported by a pair of kneeling angels, and a basket of fruit. Trimmed with red silk ribbons. A ribbon bow at the top, for purposes of suspension, of red silk stamped with a semi0naturalistic floral design in green. White silk over white linen, over white cotton. Worn; fabric missing in some areas on reverse."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/7afd7a23-c59c-3fd6-8089-15a991107e7c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c90d4c5f-42a4-32e7-b83f-9069479de656> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Hanging pocket case. Three rectangular pockets, one above the other, with a triangular upside down pocket at the top. A white silk ground quilted and embroidered with white silk and floss silk yarns. Designs include: a peacock and swan, a monogram topped by a crown, a heraldic rampant horse on a round shield with a helmet crest flanked and supported by a pair of kneeling angels, and a basket of fruit. Trimmed with red silk ribbons. A ribbon bow at the top, for purposes of suspension, of red silk stamped with a semi0naturalistic floral design in green. White silk over white linen, over white cotton. Worn; fabric missing in some areas on reverse."@en ;
